(text "19 V supply -> panel jack -> split block TB1 (on Level 2's floor). TB1's - side is the COMMON GROUND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f3501c3-dcb6-5ab4-bd90-ab468579294e"))
(text "The Jetson is fed straight from TB1: always on, never switched or fused here (the supply limits it)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 183.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ec48af56-2ddf-51c9-9cab-a70be9008d9a"))
(text "Head side: TB1 + -> panel fuse F1 (6 x 30 mm, 3 A slow-blow) -> rocker switch SW1 -> perfboard J1 (+19V_SW)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 187.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2ce00b23-6b54-5582-8db8-5c3ca26c732f"))
(text "Fuse holder: TB1 to its END contact, its SIDE contact to the switch (an unscrewed cap's exposed end is dead)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 191.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6cb223ae-36a6-5389-b4d2-f70726b2ebb4"))
